@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# enginehost RPG Maker integration
+
+This branch turns the existing mkxp-z Android port into one programmatically
+driven `enginehost` plugin family:
+
+- `xp`, `vx`, and `vxace` contexts run through the bundled mkxp-z/RGSS
+  implementation.
+- `mv` and `mz` contexts run their deployed `index.html` directly from the
+  live game folder in Android WebView.
+
+The exported `EngineHostRunActivity` is the only enginehost entry point. It
+validates the requested folder and routes using the host-provided
+`engineContext`; it does not import or copy games.
+
+## Upstream and licensing
+
+This work is based on thehatkid's `mkxp-z-android` commit
+`468fe8128a40cc7d2cba4ac7fbe21a82787de255`, which vendors mkxp-z and its
+GPL-2.0-or-later `COPYING` file under `app/jni/mkxp-z/COPYING`. The native
+runtime remains GPL-2.0-or-later and the integration must be distributed with
+corresponding source and all upstream notices intact. Dependency sources are
+fetched at the versions selected by upstream's `app/jni/get_deps.sh`.
+
+The integration deliberately preserves upstream authorship and limits changes
+to the programmatic path seam, runtime dispatcher, HTML5 activity, Android
+identity, and enginehost capability metadata.
+
+## Storage boundary
+
+This branch does not declare or request `MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`. Android's
+normal storage sandbox therefore still applies to the in-place folder passed
+by enginehost.
+
+Android builds run only in GitHub Actions.
